The named controls are otherwise real—rc.3/current exact `NO-GO` changed from server `0→3` and guard `0→13`, authorizing decisions still pass, all-mode wiring is intact, and payload 1 has no adopter install/upgrade blast radius—but either P1 still permits an ambiguous or malformed signed artifact to authorize release.

