The release workflow reaches the all-modes guard correctly, but adversarial fence parsing exposed an untested authorization bypass; I’m validating its scope and running the read-only gates before assigning severity.
  ✓ Inspect candidate state, governing files, and exact payload-1 diff context
  → Trace both decision readers and release workflow paths for bypasses
  • Audit regression controls for defect fidelity and vacuity
